   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors) | 5.41 GB |\n| `loras/` | [moss_image_color_depth_control.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/loras/moss_image_color_depth_control.safetensors) | 0.31 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors) | 7.34 GB |\n| `vae/` | [flux2-vae_small.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors) | 0.25 GB |\n| `geometry_estimation/` | [moge_3_vitl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MoGe/resolve/main/geometry_estimation/moge_3_vitl_fp16.safetensors) | 0.74 GB |\n\nMoGe goes in a folder ComfyUI creates for it, `models/geometry_estimation/`. ViT-L (0.74 GB) instead of the template's ViT-G (2.5 GB).\n\n**VRAM:** Whole card peaked at 9.0 to 9.5 GiB in a 10 GiB budget on the 24 GB card. Not verified on a 12 GB card. Without a budget: 15.9 to 16.1 GiB.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3. No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: MOSS-Image is Apache-2.0. Workflow: MIT.\n"
   ]
  }
